e of 40 score is 7, below the 40 that marks a healthy growth business.","It has missed earnings estimates by 11.4% on average."],"own":["Insiders hold little stock (0.8%), and reported institutional holdings exceed 100% of shares (a sign of heavy share lending).","Insider trading is two-way: 1 purchase and 2 sales over the past year, net $2.0M sold.","It returns 6.0% a year to shareholders (3.6% in buybacks and 1.2% in dividends).","The share count has shrunk 2.4% a year over five years, steadily raising each holder's stake.","It has paid a dividend for 20 consecutive years, raising it 2.6% a year over the last five."],"people":["With about 1,300 employees, each generates about $3.6M of revenue, 10.1x the Industrials median, and revenue has grown 4.2% a year across its filed history.","That works out to $165K of free cash flow per employee.","CEO pay is $1.1M (0x revenue per employee), and compensation governance scores well (3/10, lower is better).","Stock compensation averages $5K per employee."]},"profile":{"v":"WATCH","conv":65,"head":"Watch: composite 43, above the 39 line, but no margin of safety; it becomes a buy below $118.","pros":["Composite 43, above the 39 line (gates 11/25)","ROIC 45.1% vs WACC 8.7%","Net cash of $395.6M","Altman Z in the safe zone","16 analysts' mean target $178 (+19%)"],"cons":["Trades 8% above fair value of $139","P/E 31.7x vs sector 24.1x","EV/EBITDA 19.0x vs sector 13.4x"],"flags":[],"need":["no margin of safety"],"buy_below":118.0,"vc":{"base":138.83,"base_src":"dcf","bear":110.47,"bull":179.11,"alt_median":42.93,"n_alt":3,"gap":2.7325,"dispersion":0.6065,"level":"LOW","why":["models disagree (61% dispersion)","DCF is 273% above the other models' median ($42.93)"]},"med":{"pe":24.0501,"ev_ebitda":13.39,"pfcf":22.9066,"pb":2.9489,"roic":0.0996,"gross_margin":0.2855,"fcf_margin":0.068,"div_yield":0.0143}},"mc_quantiles":[91.55,103.54,110.47,114.89,119.66,122.99,126.67,129.81,132.94,136.1,139.95,142.8,146.06,150.21,154.02,158.38,163.